"P2283935604" "<color orange>You've found what you can only assume is a tear in the fabric of reality. It appears that the spirits infesting the Seer Network Facility are coming from them. You've got to find a way to seal them before more souls flood out of them.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SeerNetworkDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P345968664" "<color orange>Only the task owner can interact with the Seer Network.</color>"
// Page NetworkComplete Text :
"P2187000812" "<color orange>The Network display blinks the number '0.00%' under the word 'Capacity'. Katie and the rest of Seers appear to have simply disappeared, and in their place, it seems, Apparitions and these tears in reality formed.</color>"
// Page NetworkIncomplete Text :
"P1604260297" "<color orange>You access the controls for the Seer Network. The display blinks the number '0.00%' under the word 'Capacity'.<br><br>Katie and the rest of Seers appear to have simply disappeared, and in their place, it seems, Apparitions and these tears in reality formed.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P369854854" "Query: Location of Seer 1381, Katie Douglas"
// Answer Text :
"P2449328679" "Query: Current Network Capacity"
// Answer Text :
"P541728758" "Access Network Logs"
// Page KatiePage1 Text :
"P1102808312" "<color orange>The Network displays a spinning five-pointed praetorian star for approximately 2 seconds before returning an error message.</color><br><br>Query complete, Seer 1381 is no longer linked to the network."
// Page KatiePage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P734693858" "Query complete<t 3>Seer 1381 is no longer linked to the network.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P118154680" "Query: Time of departure from Network for Seer 1381."
// Page CapacityPage1 Text :
"P2009755487" "<color orange>The Network displays a spinning five-pointed praetorian star for a split-second before returning the following message.</color><br><br>Query complete, Network is currently at 0.00% capacity. Awaiting integration of Seers to network."
// Page CapacityPage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P3635451550" "Query complete<t 3>Network is currently at 0.00% capacity.<t 3>Awaiting integration of Seers to network.<t 0.1>"
// Page DeparturePage1 Text :
"P1632433075" "<color orange>The Network displays a spinning five-pointed praetorian star for approximately 5 seconds before returning the following message.</color><br><br>Subject: Seer 1381<br>Name: Katie Douglas<br>Status: Unknown<br>Departure: Unknown<br>Notes: Diagnostic required, unable to receive signal from subject - Seer 1381. Possible maintenance failure. All links to Networked Seers as of this time stamp have failed.<br><br><color orange>The time stamp appears to be only several minutes old.</color>"
// Page DeparturePage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P2905519002" "Subject: Seer 1381<t 3>Name: Katie Douglas<t 3>Status: Unknown<t 3>Departure: Unknown<t 3>Notes: Diagnostic required, unable to receive signal from subject - Seer 1381.<t 3> Possible maintenance failure.<t 3>All links to Networked Seers as of this time stamp have failed.<t 0.1>"
// Page LogsPage1 Text :
"P3443133148" "<color orange>The Network displays a spinning five-pointed praetorian star for about 12 seconds before giving out more information. As you read it over, you hear an odd voice in the distance.</color><br><br>Kiy-yi! You won't find Katie Douglas that way!"
// Answer Text :
"P1445298762" "Who's there?"
// Page CoyotePage Text :
"P3302390311" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Whispering_Coyote_NoRing width=128 height=128>Ki-yi-yi! I am Whispering Coyote, Blind Makwa's spirit companion. Ki-yi-yi!<br><br>Ki-yi! The barrier between worlds has grown weak. The Netherworld is merging with First Ward to create the Night Ward! If it continues, then disaster will befall everyone, ki-yi-yi!<br><br>First, you must rescue Katie Douglas, she is the key to it all! I will guide you through the Night Ward to her. A tear is opening now! You must go through it and trust me, ki-yi-yi! Just be careful, the <color red>Drudges</color> are here!"
// Answer Text :
"P971435282" "I suppose I don't have much of a choice...!"
// Page TriggerPortalSpawn Text :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PortalTP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2699275071" "Teleporting!"
// Answer Text :
"P1939340389" "Ask about information."

