"P63979493" "Enter the portal into Night Ward"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2368547630" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Something is very wrong, {HeroName}...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I didn't notice it before, but the minds in the Seer Network are not Seers...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>They're the minds... no... that isn't it... they're the memories...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>The memories... of the dead!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>There are thousands... No...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Tens of thousands... Millions!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>It's... it's too much. It's overwhelming!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I can't pick Katie's mind out of it all, you must find the source of these memories and silence them!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2768328950" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>That's the source of these memories, {HeroName}!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Some sort of hole into the Nether World. You've got to close it, quickly!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2072732828" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Yes, sealing those tears in reality is silencing the memories of the dead.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Close them all and then I can figure out where Katie is and what happened here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4155898570" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I can't sense Katie or any of the other Seers, {HeroName}.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Get to the Network Interface and see if you can find out what happened to them...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Please tell me they are still alive..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2915246148" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Katie and the Seers are... missing? Where could they have...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Oh no... {HeroName}! Praetor Tilman is here!!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2166087098" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Even Tilman doesn't seem to know what happened to the Seers.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>You'd better get out of there immediately, {HeroName}. Once she realizes that Commander Dawson failed to apprehend you she may decide to come back and take care of you herself."

