"P151324149" "Ki-ki-yi-yi!<t 1>Drudges!<t 3>{HeroName}, these guys -hate- outsiders to the spirit realm.<t 3>They might have already found Katie!<t 3>Oh... This is not good...<t 3>Ki-yi!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P3780893440" "<shout>Ki-yi-yi-yi-yi!<t 1>Wait up, {HeroName}.<t 4>Ki-yi!<t 0.2>"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveText :
"P1935128998" "Go with Whispering Coyote to Katie Douglas"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3609192693" "{HeroName}, it's you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1192044598" "Ki-yi-yi!<t 1>Drudges have the job of escorting souls to their proper afterlife.<t 3>They hate anyone that interferes with the way of things.<t 3>If there is one thing the Drudges and their Taskmasters hate, it is outsiders mucking with their efficiency.<t 4>Ki-yi!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3377238994" "Ki-yi-yi-yi!<t 1>The Drudges must be investigating what is going on as well.<t 3>They probably think that Katie and the other Seers are responsible.<t 3>They'll want to question them first, I just hope we aren't too late.<t 4>Ki-yi!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P225457485" "Ki-yi-yi-yi!<t 1>Katie! Katie Douglas! Wake up! {HeroName} is here to rescue you, ki-yi!"

