// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1496752393" "Watcher Thorn"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4016895081" "Hup hup, ears to nostrils, lads!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2540932458" "Wez got ourselves 'nother filthy weezer!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4056837090" "*sniff sniff* You smell that?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3796662742" "More of you, eh?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3108691030" "I 'eard the whole Taskmaster's Office ain't got a clue what's goin' on."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3041996488" "An' now more outsiders? Can't ya be the reasonable sort an' die like everyone else 'fore ya become a bother?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4158869698" "I can smell another."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P20409674" "You come to the world of the dead, then you stay in the world of the dead, weezer!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1122094719" "I ain't gotten paid for my last seventeen shifts.<t 3>This is rubbish!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2507833977" "Maybe makin' this thrumper sing 'ill earn us a pinch of wax or two, eh?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2150197520" "<t 3>I think it's worth a scrap.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1735892711" "<t 3>Quiet, I 'eard somethin'<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1568964856" "I can smell the stink of the living here, can't you?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1286842256" "There's a 'eartbeat!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P608334598" "<t 2>Dirty outsider!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3279877088" "Need me some more wax or my candle is snuffed, ya know?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1059891317" "All you outsiders are good for is being dead, so hop to it."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_NAME :
"P1150034928" "Spirit Guide"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3189281751" "Listen, all I'm sayin' is that given current workin' conditions, your average Spirit Guide ain't goin' ta be able ta keep 'is candle burnin'.<t 5>You aren't listenin', mate. There ain't an unlimited number of livin', it takes 'em time to, to, like, grow more of 'em, or whatever, before they go and get dead. What if this spike is a sign of a slow down to come?<t 5>What if all this that's happenin', right now, is the start of the collapse of it all?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2440124765" "<t 2>Seriously?<t 1>Can't you hear that we're in the middle of an intense socio-economic discussion?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3558302368" "<t 5>Poppycock! The Taskmasters know what they're doing.<t 2>I mean, look, there's a massive influx of dead with no sign of it slowing down, work is plentiful and the job ain't goin' ta do itself, is it?<t 5>Slow down? Rubbish, the living do nothin' better than kill 'emselves off.<t 5>This slowdown is a trend, nothin' more. Whatever -this- is, it ain't due to the livin' stoppin' killin' each other, that's fer sure.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1310532973" "Oh, what do you want?"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3177773160" "Hello there."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3671939527" "Katie Douglas"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2190274664" "Ah... Ahhhh!<t 4>What...<t 1> What the hell happened!?<t 3>{HeroName}?<t 1>I don't even know -where- this place you found me is, but...<t 5>Ok, the spirit realm? Are you friggin' kidding me?<t=5>We'll talk about this later, {HeroName}.<t 3>Get me outta here!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2353339810" "Ah... Ahhhh!<t 4>What...<t 1> What the hell happened!?<t 3>{HeroName}?<t 1>I don't even know -where- this place you found me is, but...<t 5>Ok, the spirit realm? Are you friggin' kidding me?<t 10>You aren't... that's... just...<t 30>Ok, I know I already said this, but, what the hell happened?<t 30>... Whoa... -that- is crazy<t 30>Ok... seriously, I'm mad and all, but... where did you get this adorable doggie?!<t 3>Squee!<t 15>Ok, fine, here's the deal. I get the dog and I stop being mad at you, ok?<t 10>Pleeeeease?<t 5>Whoa... this dog has got a seriously warped mind.<t 5>Ha ha, yeah, I am kinda awesome, aren't I, pooch?<t 10>Ok, {HeroName}, I think we should probably beat feet before Praetor Tilman and the rest of the IDF shows up to get revenge.<t 0.1>"

