// Dialog :
"P3136741560" "You did it! I can sense Katie's mind once more, but the spirit world is merging closer to our own with every heartbeat, {HeroName}.<br><br>I spoke with Blind Makwa, and according to him, Whispering Coyote believes that the secret to stopping the transition lies within <color red>the Midnight Mansion</color>... well now it seems we have recovered our means to return there, assuming Katie is willing to help."

